{"task":"transcribe","language":"en","duration":75.4430625,"text":"Nimbus, wake up. Let's make some money today. Good morning, sir. Nine agents online. Markets are moving. Say the word. Alright, Nimbus. I want to meet your team. Can you introduce me to your team? You want to meet the desk? Very well, sir. Teams sound off. Atlas, when the money printer turns on, I'm the first to know. Capital, when Trump or Pelosi buy us stuff, I know before the news does. Scout, whatever stocks going viral today, I found it an hour ago. Athena, I read the boring legal filings. All of them, even the footnotes. Charters, I draw the lines where to buy and where to run. Oracle, I whisper where the price goes next. Probabilities, darling, never promises. Sentinel risk officer, my favorite word is no. Pilot, Sentinel signs off. I execute the trade. No cowboy stuff. Ledger, I remember every call this desk makes, especially the bad ones. And I am Nimbus. I run this desk. Give the word, sir.","words":null,"segments":[{"avg_logprob":-0.24613373058358418,"compression_ratio":1.5047169811320755,"end":3.0,"id":1,"no_speech_prob":0.021302612498402596,"seek":0,"start":0.0,"temperature":0.0,"text":" Nimbus, wake up. Let's make some money today.","tokens":[50364,426,17306,301,11,6634,493,13,961,311,652,512,1460,965,13,50514],"words":null},{"avg_logprob":-0.24613373058358418,"compression_ratio":1.5047169811320755,"end":9.5,"id":2,"no_speech_prob":0.021302612498402596,"seek":0,"start":4.5,"temperature":0.0,"text":" Good morning, sir. Nine agents online. Markets are moving. Say the word.","tokens":[50589,2205,2446,11,4735,13,18939,12554,2950,13,3934,1385,366,2684,13,6463,264,1349,13,50839],"words":null},{"avg_logprob":-0.24613373058358418,"compression_ratio":1.5047169811320755,"end":14.2,"id":3,"no_speech_prob":0.021302612498402596,"seek":0,"start":10.2,"temperature":0.0,"text":" Alright, Nimbus. I want to meet your team. Can you introduce me to your team?","tokens":[50874,2798,11,426,17306,301,13,286,5